# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Setup {#setup}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Begin by importing the necessary libraries and defining the helper functions that build the quantum circuits for the LSH time evolution. There are three core circuit-building functions:\n"
msgstr "Mulakan dengan mengimport pustaka yang diperlukan dan mentakrifkan fungsi pembantu yang membina Circuit kuantum untuk evolusi masa LSH. Terdapat tiga fungsi pembinaan Circuit teras:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`pair_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Implements the two-qubit unitary $U_I$ for the approximate interaction Hamiltonian between neighboring sites. The gate decomposition is: $\\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to R_z(-c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to \\text{CNOT}$.\n"
msgstr "**`pair_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Mengimplementasikan unitari dua-qubit $U_I$ untuk Hamiltonian interaksi anggaran antara tapak bersebelahan. Penguraian gate ialah: $\\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to R_z(-c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(c) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to H \\to \\text{CNOT}$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`electric_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Implements the two-qubit unitary $U_E$ for the approximate electric field energy at each site. The gate decomposition is: $X \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(-\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to X$.\n"
msgstr "**`electric_hamiltonian_circuit`**: Mengimplementasikan unitari dua-qubit $U_E$ untuk tenaga medan elektrik anggaran pada setiap tapak. Penguraian gate ialah: $X \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(-\\theta/2) \\to \\text{CNOT} \\to R_z(\\theta/2) \\to X$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`construct_circuit`**: Assembles the full Trotterized circuit, layering interaction, electric, and mass terms with SWAP gates to manage qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr "**`construct_circuit`**: Menghimpunkan Circuit Trotterized penuh, melapiskan sebutan interaksi, elektrik, dan jisim dengan gate SWAP untuk menguruskan konektiviti Qubit.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, demonstrate the workflow at small scale using a six-site lattice (12 qubits), so that you can verify circuit construction and understand the physical observables before running on hardware.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, tunjukkan aliran kerja pada skala kecil menggunakan kekisi enam-tapak (12 Qubit), supaya anda boleh mengesahkan pembinaan Circuit dan memahami cerapan fizikal sebelum menjalankan pada perkakasan.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the physical parameters matching the weak-coupling regime studied in the paper ($x = 100$, $m/g = 1$). The derived circuit parameters are:\n"
msgstr "Takrifkan parameter fizikal yang sepadan dengan rejim gandingan lemah yang dikaji dalam kertas kerja ($x = 100$, $m/g = 1$). Parameter Circuit terbitan ialah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$c = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot x = 0.15$ (interaction parameter)\n"
msgstr "$c = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot x = 0.15$ (parameter interaksi)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\theta = -\\delta_\\tau (\\bar{n}_l/2 + 3/4) = 0.01$ (electric field phase)\n"
msgstr "$\\theta = -\\delta_\\tau (\\bar{n}_l/2 + 3/4) = 0.01$ (fasa medan elektrik)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\tilde{m} = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot \\mu = 0.03$ (mass parameter)\n"
msgstr "$\\tilde{m} = \\delta_\\tau \\cdot \\mu = 0.03$ (parameter jisim)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each Trotter step count, build **two circuits**: one initializing a meson at the center (`inverse_mid=True`) and one preparing the strong-coupling vacuum (`inverse_mid=False`). The differential measurement protocol subtracts the vacuum evolution to isolate the hadron signal.\n"
msgstr "Untuk setiap kiraan langkah Trotter, bina **dua Circuit**: satu memulakan meson di tengah (`inverse_mid=True`) dan satu menyediakan vakum gandingan kuat (`inverse_mid=False`). Protokol pengukuran pembezaan menolak evolusi vakum untuk mengasingkan isyarat hadron.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/loop-string-hadron-dynamics/extracted-outputs/step1-circuits-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/loop-string-hadron-dynamics/extracted-outputs/step1-circuits-1.avif)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the observables: single-qubit $Z$ measurements on every qubit. From $\\langle Z \\rangle$ you can extract occupation probabilities and then the staggered fermion number $n_f(r)$ at each lattice site $r$.\n"
msgstr "Takrifkan cerapan: pengukuran $Z$ satu-qubit pada setiap Qubit. Daripada $\\langle Z \\rangle$ anda boleh mengekstrak kebarangkalian pekerjaan dan kemudian nombor fermion tersusun-selang-seli $n_f(r)$ pada setiap tapak kekisi $r$.\n"

